than the test quietly deleted -- being wrong about why a test matters belongs next to the test.
AT-144: hardcoding max_screens=999 left all 633 green. Those two bounds never reach an approval
(consent bounds actions/probes/wall-clock only), so nothing could notice them unwired -- and they
decide how much of a live production ERP gets touched.
