and an unrelated target. The SAFETY property always held (require_consent refuses all three at run
time); what was wrong is WHAT THE HUMAN IS TOLD. A gate that reports success for a grant it will
never honour trains the operator to stop reading it -- and that operator is granting production
consent for T-145.
